=== NOT EXECUTABLE on this bench (environmental, NOT a regression) ===

The dry-run smoke opens a vkms DRM card and calls acquire_master_lock().
On this bench Hyprland + systemd-logind ALREADY HOLD DRM master on the
vkms card (card0), so acquire_master_lock() returns EACCES (Permission
denied, os error 13) BEFORE the render path is reached. This is the
SAME documented environmental constraint recorded in QA v5-5, v6-5, v8,
v9 (audit-A-dryrun.log in each): "the master-gated sim path CANNOT
execute here (Hyprland holds vkms master)". It is NOT an ADR-043
regression: the failure is at SimDisplay::acquire(), which runs BEFORE
backlight.enable() — the enable-write is downstream of acquire and is
not reached on this bench.

